  openingText: "Phlox's Note\n\n“The sunny rooms are the easiest to love. The light comes in properly here, even through the dirty glass. There's a fireplace in the room with beds that smells like old bread and smoke. There is something in there.”"
  completionText: "Phlox's Note\n\n“It opened its mouth for me. I really thought it was going to bite. There was a stone inside instead, warm as a windowsill. I wanted to keep it. I didn't, though. I think it belongs to the tree.”"
